      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Willow_Glen%2C_San_Jose"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "When the Southern Pacific rerouted its main line in the 1920s, the new track ran through what is now North Willow Glen, home to Caltrain.",
